From: SST Build <sst-build@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Share ordinary held vase actors

Observe validated SSHD 1.0.0 vase carry references and transforms, replay the matching existing actor on its native execution thread, and retain confirmed placement without assigning remote holder pointers.
---
